            "key": "respMajorCoordinationMechanismDesc1",
            "namespace": "drefImportTemplate",
            "value": "List coordination mechanisms/platform in place at local/district and national level. Indicate the lead authorities/agencies. How the National Society is involved/positioned in this coordination. Does the NS in any lead/co-lead role? Any identified gap/overlap in the coordination (e.g., sector missing…)?"
